        "density": 0.17302,
        "chars": 327,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 10.63
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        232,
        1462,
        1469,
        1640
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, in adopting this non-legally binding \"working definition\" of antisemitism, the member states of the IHRA invoked the 1972 United Nations Conference on the Human Environment's Stockholm Declaration that states \"With humanity still scarred by [] antisemitism and xenophobia the international community shares a solemn responsibility to fight those evils;\" and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
